| *   n_r2=52 (K = 7.917): vref_max 1.22394..1.22507 -- over the 1.224 V
| *     ceiling at 6 of 15 points. FAIL.
| * n_r1 is held at 7 for the same reason issue #99 held it: R1 sets the branch
